<h2>The timeline that spoke for itself</h2>
<div class="flow">
  <div class="fstep"><strong>6 March 2007.</strong> FIR No. 369/2007 registered at PS Sultan Puri under Sections 468, 471, 420 and 120B IPC.</div>
